  "description": "Block-aware web scraping engine for .NET 9/10: request queue with priorities and de-duplication, retries with backoff, response checks (blocked, not found, cut-off pages), sessions of a client with its cookies, a user agent and an http/socks proxy (from a file, a URL or an API) kept while they do well, block policies for proxies and user agents, per-host throttling on 429/503, robots.txt, sitemaps, link depth, runs that resume after a crash, routing by page type or label with typed page data, async handlers and streamed results of any type. HTML is parsed with z3l.FastHtmlParser.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
